sition: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603290656168311_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603290656168311_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺消息，米兰签下贝尔格莱德游击前锋安德烈·科斯蒂奇达协议，Here we go。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-29/69c829feec5b9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">德转身价最贵阵：姆巴佩、哈兰德、亚马尔均2亿欧，库巴西在列</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603290321142282.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603290321142282_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260329/202603290321142282_720.jpg"> </div><p>德转盘点了最新足坛最贵阵容，总身价达14.1亿欧，姆巴佩、哈兰德、亚马尔均2亿欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-28/69c7ee47b21a9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">无视非足联剥夺冠军决定！塞内加尔赛前向球迷展示非洲杯冠军奖杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260328/202603282313417941.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-inden